OL,3,APolice accept Andrew search warrants
OL,4,Awere unlawful, court hears
OL,5,
OL,6,FThames Valley Police has accepted that
OL,7,Fthe search warrants it used to search
OL,8,FAndrew Mountbatten-Windsor's homes
OL,9,Fearlier this year were unlawful, the
OL,10,FHigh Court has heard.
OL,12,FThe force said it accepted that the
OL,13,F"initial court's decision to issue
OL,14,Fwarrants under the specific piece of
OL,15,Flegislation used was incorrect" before
OL,16,Fthey searched the former prince's
OL,17,Fproperties on 19 February.
OL,19,FAndrew was arrested by Thames Valley
OL,20,FPolice on suspicion of misconduct in
OL,21,Fpublic. He denies any wrongdoing.
OL,23,APub: 08-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
